# A delay-4 repeater turns the observer's 2gt pulse into exactly 8gt (on at t+10, off at t+18),
# for both lever edges. A second pulse arriving while the output is still on is swallowed.
design designs/gadgets/pulse-stretch.txt
probe out 3 1 0
use 0 1 0
expect_trace out 000000000++++++++000000
use 0 1 0
expect_trace out 000000000++++++++000000
